{C:81938400}{C:819582965B1E00000000}Unidentified ship, do you read me?
I am AEUG's {C:819782830400}Quattro Bajeena.{C:819782830000}
We welcome your ship into port.

{C:819582965D1E00000000}I repeat.
We welcome your ship into port.


{x00}

{C:81930100}{C:81958296CB1E00000000}...Ah, it's no good.
I don't understand machines from other continents.

{x00}

{C:81938A00}{C:81958296CC1E00000000}Has it broken down?
I'll take a look for you.




{x00}

{C:81908A00}{C:81958296D51E00000000}There, it's fixed.
That should do it.


{x00}

{C:81908A00}{C:81958296571F00000000}He had such honest eyes...

{C:81958296581F00000000}Maybe I'll give it another try...



{x00}

{C:81938F00}{C:81958296881F00000000}Kamille!
I won't let you get away!



{x00}

{C:81939500}{C:81958296D11F00000000}Were you made
to torment me? I hate you!




{x00}

{C:81939500}{C:81958296E21F00000000}Kamille... Kamille...
Does this mean I won't have to forget?


{x00}

{C:81938200}{C:81958296E71F00000000}Four...
Was this really the right thing...? Fouuur!




{x00}

{C:81900C00}{C:81958296E81F00000000}So this place is already caught up in conflict.
Just what I need.


{x00}

{C:81900400}{C:819582967B2000000000}In our position,
we have no choice but to accept his condition.


{x00}

{C:8193C800}{C:81958296B32000000000}It's about time Gregore got back.
Go straight back to {C:819782830300}Uoodo{C:819782830000}.


{x00}

{C:8193C800}{C:81958296B52000000000}I thought I told you
to head straight for Uoodo.


{x00}

{C:81930300}{C:819582964B2100000000}We made a promise to Chirico, so we have to go back to 
{C:819782830300}Gilgamesh{C:819782830000}.



{x00}

{C:8190E100}{C:81958296532100000000}Then I'll finish him off myself.
I can't allow Chirico to live.


{x00}

{C:81932300}{C:81958296310000000000}I wouldn't know!
I only just got here!!

{x00}

{C:81931C00}{C:81958296DA2100000000}All that effort... all that effort...
Then I'll kill you!!

{x00}

{C:81930300}{C:81958296E52100000000}I'm Rie Akatsuki,
captain of the Astante.

{x00}

{C:81930100}{C:819582965B2200000000}Yeah, I understand.
I'll be right there.





{x00}

{C:81932300}{C:81958296380000000000}You're always the ones
who attack first!

{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:819582966D2200000000}What the hell are you babbling about?!
Sho!


{x00}

{C:81902700}{C:819582969E2200000000}Flying a machine I'm not used to is tiring.
I'm going to get some rest right away.


{x00}

{C:81902300}{C:81958296440000000000}I'm sure they came this way.
Are they going to see Drake directly?



{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:81958296A62200000000}There you are, Zelerna!
Bring Sho out, damn you!

{x00}

{C:81931E00}{C:81958296A72200000000}Sho?!
I don't know anyone by that name.

{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:81958296A82200000000}You bastards
are hiding him, aren't you?!



{x00}

{C:81932600}{C:81958296CC2200000000}I'm sorry I can't do anything, young people.
I wish you victory in battle.



{x00}

{C:81930400}{C:81958296D22200000000}Nie and the others are waiting.
Let's go to the Kingdom of Lau.


{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:81958296F02200000000}You're persistent.
People don't like that, you know.


{x00}

{C:81900E01}{C:81958296DA2300000000}Mardoul's subordinate {C:819782830400}Lordan{C:819782830000}
has attacked us.
May we ask for your help?

{C:81930100}{C:81958296DB2300000000}Of course!



{x00}

{C:81900400}{C:81958296542400000000}Jojo hasn't come this way.

{C:81930100}{C:81958296552400000000}All right. I'll try somewhere else.


{x00}

{C:81900C00}{C:81958296C52400000000}They're working so dutifully for me.

{C:81900200}{C:81958296C72400000000}What are you plotting?


{x00}

{C:81905401}{C:81958296CF2400000000}I'm glad you came down. I'd like to talk, but I have something to do. Sorry, come with me a moment.

{C:81930100}{C:81958296D02400000000}Uh... All right.



{x00}

{C:81907C00}{C:819582969C2500000000}Destroying an HM with his bare hands...
What an absurd human being!!



{x00}

{C:81905401}{C:81958296BA2500000000}I came as promised!
Now give Mikoto back!!


{x00}

{C:81935401}{C:81958296F72500000000}I'm joining up with you!
Open the hatch!



{x00}

{C:81930C00}{C:81958296192600000000}It's time to leave this continent too.
Shall I head for the next one...?




{x00}

{C:81930100}{C:81958296602500000000}(Come to think of it, I first met Lun
in a place like this.)


{x00}

{C:81906F00}{C:81958296682600000000}Welcome aboard my ship, the Whale.
Choose whatever you like.


{x00}

{C:81906F00}{C:819582966A2600000000}Welcome, youngster.
What brings you here today?


{x00}

{C:81937C00}{C:81958296772600000000}We are Posaydal's army.
We'll attack anyone who approaches {C:819782830300}Sveto{C:819782830000}
no matter who they are!!



{x00}

{C:81930B00}{C:81958296A30000000000}What's that ghost of war...
planning after all this time...?


{x00}

{C:81938200}{C:81958296142800000000}This is... a Gundam?

{C:81938A00}{C:81958296152800000000}Yes. AEUG developed the {C:819782830400}Zeta Gundam.{C:819782830000}
It's your new machine.
You should try it out later.

{C:81908200}{C:81958296162800000000}Thank you very much!




{x00}

{C:81935F00}{C:81958296412800000000}You just do whatever the hell you please.
Fine, I'll do it myself!


{x00}

{C:81938400}{C:819582967B2800000000}I'm sorry, but I'd like you
to head for Hong Kong City.



{x00}

{C:81938F00}{C:81958296BC2800000000}I won't let you bastards do as you please!
I'll shoot you down right here!!



{x00}

{C:8190A102}{C:81958296BD2800000000}Ah! There you are, Kamille!
You idiooot!!


{x00}

{C:81909500}{C:81958296EF2800000000}Kamille? It's Kamille!!
Um, that way!



{x00}

{C:81930C00}{C:81958296562A00000000}Sink, Astante...
and take my life with you!





{x00}

{C:81932C01}{C:81958296802A00000000}Hah... hah... hah... I finally won!
Now, do as I say...


{x00}

{C:81932C01}{C:81958296852A00000000}Damn it!
I'll let you off today!


{x00}

{C:8193C602}{C:81958296E92A00000000}Well, this is a predicament.
{C:819782830400}Toya{C:819782830000} and the others have gotten separated from us.

{C:8193C902}{C:81958296EA2A00000000}What're you gonna do now?
Well, {C:819782830400}Greyfus?{C:819782830000}

{C:8193C702}{C:81958296EB2A00000000}Hey, {C:819782830400}Teddyam,{C:819782830000}
it's not Greyfus's fault
we got separated.

{C:8193C802}{C:81958296EC2A00000000}Let's ask that person over there.


{x00}

{C:81930100}{C:819582960B2C00000000}You two, stop arguing.
Astante II, launch!




{x00}

{C:8193E901}{C:81958296132C00000000}...They're coming!
All hands, battle stations!!




{x00}

{C:81931701}{C:81958296D50100000000}I cannot allow the likes of you
to face His Majesty.

{x00}

{C:81930A01}{C:81958296252C00000000}Have you still not realized
that Mardoul isn't the only enemy?!

{x00}

{C:81931701}{C:81958296D60100000000}Do you mock His Majesty?!!
His Majesty is being manipulated by no one!





{x00}

{C:81931601}{C:81958296262C00000000}So you have driven High back.
Your strength... is most reassuring.

{x00}

{C:8190C302}{C:81958296542C00000000}People who fight in machines
sure have a lot of maintenance to do.


{x00}

{C:81900A01}{C:81958296722C00000000}Well then, I'll go
and talk to the people in the valley!


{x00}

{C:81900300}{C:81958296E12C00000000}Everyone has their own reasons
for being aboard this ship,
so please make yourself at home.




{x00}

{C:81930400}{C:819582965B2D00000000}I've confirmed an explosion in Tokio!

{C:81935401}{C:819582965C2D00000000}Mikoto! Mikoto!


{x00}

{C:81935401}{C:819582965D2D00000000}Mamoru?!
And those are the Gao-Machines!


{x00}

{C:81937B02}{C:819582966F2D00000000}In the end... we never
got introduced.




{x00}

{C:81935501}{C:81958296832D00000000}Don't get in my way, big bro Guy!
There's no time left!

{x00}

{C:81935501}{C:819582968E2D00000000}Now I'm going to surpass you,
big bro Guy!


{x00}

{C:81932C01}{C:81958296F42D00000000}I can sense it...
Eiji's scent!

{x00}

{C:8190B402}{C:81958296162E00000000}So you've come, you brats!
I'll send you to your graves right here!!



{x00}

{C:81938F00}{C:81958296F72C00000000}You're back, Astante II!
Today I'll settle this once and for all!!


{x00}

{C:81935102}{C:81958296100100000000}Is that you, Rooose?
What are you doing on a ship like that?

{x00}

{C:81905102}{C:819582961C0100000000}It can't be helped.
I'm counting on you from now on.




{x00}

{C:81935E02}{C:81958296222F00000000}I've been paid plenty.
This time I'll teach them a lesson!




{x00}

{C:81930D00}{C:81958296492F00000000}Commander Gresco has been shot!

{C:81932B01}{C:819582964A2F00000000}You bastaaard!!


{x00}

{C:8190B502}{C:81958296CD2F00000000}Welcome, you fools!
I will deal with you personally!






{x00}

{C:81909400}{C:819582969F3600000000}Until this fighting is over,
I'll be counting on you.




{x00}

{C:8190E401}{C:819582968C2900000000}I guarantee this will be of at least some use.
Now go.


{x00}

{C:81935300}{C:81958296E62F00000000}What's that!?
Are they Posaydal's people!?

{x00}

{C:81932000}{C:81958296023000000000}We're being pursued by Drake's forces.
We request rescue from the Astante II.


{x00}

{C:81932000}{C:81958296033000000000}We're being pursued by Drake's forces.
They're here!


{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:81958296063000000000}I'm pulling back for now,
but get ready to lose your heads, Astante II!



{x00}

{C:81932700}{C:81958296743000000000}A tiny battleship like this
isn't worth a damn.


{x00}

{C:81933800}{C:81958296793000000000}Heh heh heh...
I never imagined it would come to this.



{x00}

{C:8190EC01}{C:819582969F3000000000}Then let me tell you
where you should go.

{x00}

{C:81933200}{C:819582963E0100000000}Why!? Why is the Cloud Sea being opened!?
I haven't lost yet!



{x00}

{C:81930100}{C:81958296B23000000000}You on that ship!
Get aboard this one, quickly!!



{x00}

{C:81935002}{C:819582967F3100000000}We're almost there.
Stay alert.


{x00}

{C:8193CD02}{C:819582968E3100000000}Jamming waaaves!
Bzz-bzz-bzzzzzz!!


{x00}

{C:8193CA02}{C:81958296963100000000}We've got the hostages back.
Let's get out of here, fast.



{x00}

{C:81930100}{C:819582962E3200000000}We'd better
not go any farther.



{x00}

{C:81933200}{C:81958296540100000000}Behold our power, uniting
all the might of Byston Well!

{x00}

{C:81931C00}{C:81958296313200000000}I hope this will make Drake
give up, but he won't, will he?

{x00}

{C:81939B00}{C:819582969E3700000000}To think you'd even create an impostor of me...
You've got some nerve, Binzvanker!



{x00}

{C:81930D00}{C:81958296633200000000}You actually came, you fools?
Then come into my world.


{x00}

{C:81930D00}{C:81958296703200000000}Impossible! I...
Impossible! Impossible! Impossiiible!!


{x00}

{C:81935300}{C:81958296723200000000}Well, we'll be going.
We have to restore Pentagona.

{x00}

{C:81938400}{C:81958296733200000000}We still have work to do
on our respective continents.

{x00}

{C:81930300}{C:81958296793200000000}Astante II
will head for Claudia.




{x00}

{C:8190D601}{C:81958296A03300000000}Hee hee hee... Perhaps
I took the joke a little too far.





{x00}

{C:81930100}{C:819582960F3300000000}Honestly,
what do they think they're doing?


{x00}

{C:81903C02}{C:81958296F63500000000}Hey, I found a good shop.
Do you want to check it out?


{x00}

{C:81903C02}{C:81958296F73500000000}You're not in the mood?
Well, it can't be helped.



{x00}

{C:81903A02}{C:81958296FA3500000000}Come by whenever
you feel like it.



{x00}

{C:81905502}{C:81958296FD3500000000}Really?
Then maybe we can go another time.



{x00}

{C:81903902}{C:81958296FE3500000000}I know a good shop through my connections.
Trust me. Do you want to give it a try?


{x00}

{C:8190CB02}{C:81958296003600000000}I know a good shop through my connections.
Trust me. Do you want to give it a try?


{x00}

{C:8190CC00}{C:819582960A3600000000}I've got a good selection,
so come back again.



{x00}

{C:8190B701}{C:819582960C3600000000}Ouch!
Then let's go next time.



{x00}

{C:8190A702}{C:819582960D3600000000}Hey, hey, I found something fun!
I'll show you, so come along!


{x00}

{C:81903402}{C:81958296103600000000}There's such a fun place to go.
What a shame.



{x00}

{C:81900C01}{C:81958296123600000000}Then let's trade
whenever you feel like it.



{x00}

{C:8190CC02}{C:81958296143600000000}Tch.
Well, I guess it can't be helped.



{x00}

{C:8190D202}{C:81958296163600000000}I've got something unusual.
I'd be willing to trade it.


{x00}

{C:8190D202}{C:81958296183600000000}I'll trade with you anytime
you feel like it.



{x00}

{C:8190D601}{C:81958296213600000000}I have something that would be useful to you all.
I would be willing to agree to a trade.


{x00}

{C:8190A802}{C:81958296233600000000}I'd hate to part with it,
but you all should be able to put it to good use.


{x00}

{C:8190A802}{C:81958296243600000000}I see. It wasn't something you needed.
Well, look forward to next time.



{x00}

{C:8190D302}{C:81958296263600000000}Well, I'll trade with you
whenever you feel like it.




{x00}

{C:8190D502}{C:81958296E00100000000}Give and take is
the basic rule, after all.



{x00}

{C:81900B00}{C:819582967C0100000000}You must have all sorts of expenses.
Take this with you.



{x00}

{C:81902400}{C:819582962B3600000000}I'm sorry this is all
I can do to help.



{x00}

{C:8190CA00}{C:819582962C3600000000}Heh-heh! Here, you can have this.
It's a present from yours truly!



{x00}

{C:8190DA00}{C:819582962F3600000000}Go, then.
My business is finished.



{x00}

{C:81900B01}{C:81958296E10100000000}Aw, Jojo's not here.
Oh well. Here, you can have this.



{x00}

{C:81900B01}{C:81958296E20100000000}Well, then,
say hi to Jojo for me!



{x00}

{C:81902301}{C:81958296383600000000}Um... I was entrusted with this
by the Liberation Front.



{x00}

{C:81902301}{C:81958296393600000000}I know all this fighting must be hard,
but please keep doing your best.



{x00}

{C:81905701}{C:819582963C3600000000}Are you hard at work and full of energy again today?
Then here's a present for you!



{x00}

{C:81905701}{C:819582963D3600000000}Do your best alongside Guy
and protect the peace.



{x00}

{C:81906401}{C:81958296403600000000}I can't do anything else to help.
I'm sorry about that.



{x00}

{C:8190B801}{C:81958296413600000000}I'm sorry it's just something I picked up,
but you can have it, bro.



{x00}

{C:8190B801}{C:81958296423600000000}If I pick up anything interesting,
I'll give it to you again!



{x00}

{C:8190D701}{C:81958296483600000000}Here's a present
for all of you working so hard.



{x00}

{C:8190D701}{C:81958296493600000000}Let's bring this fighting to an end
as soon as possible.



{x00}

{C:8190E701}{C:819582964B3600000000}I'll have something ready for you.
Come back again.



{x00}

{C:81905402}{C:819582964D3600000000}I only happened to come by it,
so don't worry about it.



{x00}

{C:8190A402}{C:819582964F3600000000}If it's all right,
please thank Master Roger.



{x00}

{C:8190D002}{C:81958296523600000000}This is to apologize for the trouble
we've been causing you over Hayato and other things.



{x00}

{C:8190D402}{C:81958296553600000000}Hurry up and beat the hell
out of them for me.



{x00}

{C:8190D702}{C:81958296593600000000}I gave it to you, so be grateful!

{C:8190D802}{C:819582965A3600000000}I'm telling you, that remark is unnecessary!



{x00}

{C:8190DA02}{C:819582965C3600000000}You helped out,
so this is to thank you!



{x00}
